      "speaker": 0,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 2.7,
      "text": "Yeah, and you worked on the original computer in this country, right?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": 1,
      "start": 2.76,
      "end": 7.73,
      "text": "I was very fortunate the Navy ordered me into the first big computer in the United States, Mark I at Harvard."
    },
    {
      "speaker": 0,
      "start": 7.86,
      "end": 11.07,
      "text": "It\u0027s called Mark 1 at Harvard. Now in those days, the thing was--"
    },
    {
      "speaker": 1,
      "start": 11.29,
      "end": 13.89,
      "text": "51 feet long, 8 feet high, and 8 feet deep."
    },
    {
      "speaker": 0,
      "start": 14.03,
      "end": 15.49,
      "text": "And that was the pocket model."
